&lt;h3&gt;Your Data&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have the right to have your personal data updated or removed. You also have the right to have a copy of the information OneTrust holds about you. Further details about these rights are available on the website in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://trustcenter-privacy.my.onetrust.com/policies/39803da3-9bb9-4709-afaf-2ba0a14d09ca?context=eyJkc1BvcnRhbElkIjoiZWM5MmYwZmEtYjFiNi00YzdlLWJmN2ItMDdlNTc2MTQyMGQxIn0%3D&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Overview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You can change your mind at any time and have your personal data removed from our database. In order to do this you must contact us and let us know you wish to be removed. The request should be made on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://privacyportal-cdn.onetrust.com/dsarwebform/37bcc497-a196-48f1-a08b-e897b5a77859/08a01c64-41fd-4b4e-9d42-cde44371a422.html&quot;&gt;Data Subject Request Form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;Recruitment fraud warning:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;OneTrust is aware of scams involving false offers of employment with our company.&amp;nbsp;The fraudulent jobs, interviews and job offers use fake websites, email addresses, group chat and text messages. Be aware that we never ask candidates for personal information, IDs or bank information during the interview process. We do not interview prospective candidates via instant message or group chat, and do not require candidates to purchase products or services, or process payments on our behalf as a condition of any employment offer. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Please note that any legitimate interview availability requests will come directly from a OneTrust recruiter with an ----- email address. You may also receive legitimate emails from ----- Recruiters will only reach out to candidates who have applied for a role through our ATS (Greenhouse) or prospects via LinkedIn InMail. Job offers will come from a recruiter and may have a ----- email address. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;For more information or if you have been targeted please reach out to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join OneTrust you are stepping onto a launching pad — the countdown has begun. The destination? A career without boundaries working alongside a diverse and inclusive crew who is passionate about doing meaningful work. As a pioneer, your voice and expertise will help chart the direction of an entirely new category. Our commitment to putting people first starts with you. Your growth is part of the mission. Our goal is to give you the power to embark on the next phase of your uniquely, unique career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneTrust provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;lcome to DKB Code Factory…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(185, 106, 217);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{ { … &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a_place_to_stay_yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/CFPUYqd.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;700&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(185, 106, 217);&quot;&gt;} } ;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{ { … &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a_place_to_stay_curious:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and grow as a React developer while shipping customer‑facing features that reduce friction for thousands of banking customers.&lt;/strong&gt; In this role you will join the Chargeback team to implement and improve the micro‑frontend for disputing card transactions, learn modern frontend engineering practices, and ship production code under mentorship. You’ll gain hands‑on experience with React and TypeScript, testing, and component design while helping shape a dependable, compliant user flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW446762 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW169101435 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW169101435 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;} } ;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{ your_responsibilities: [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, improve, and maintain features and customer flows within our &lt;strong&gt;Chargeback micro-frontend&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop functional, stable, and well-tested frontend solutions that follow agreed designs, flows, and development guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with &lt;strong&gt;frontend and backend developers, UX, product, and QA&lt;/strong&gt; to turn requirements and designs into working solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate APIs in collaboration with backend developers and build your understanding of API design and the wider technical architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in &lt;strong&gt;code reviews&lt;/strong&gt;, use feedback to improve your work, and contribute to shared frontend standards and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an understanding of the &lt;strong&gt;Chargeback domain&lt;/strong&gt;, including customer journeys, stakeholders, APIs, and third-party dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of your assigned tasks, proactively work through problems, and know when to involve or ask for support from teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously develop your frontend skills and gradually take greater ownership across the software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX0 SCXW188870906&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX0 SCXW188870906&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX0 SCXW188870906&quot;&gt; } ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good foundations in &lt;strong&gt;HTML, CSS, and JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt;, with an understanding of how websites, the DOM, and browser APIs work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with or foundational knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;React&lt;/strong&gt; and a motivation to deepen your frontend development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong &lt;strong&gt;learning mindset&lt;/strong&gt;: you actively seek feedback, learn from mistakes, and apply what you have learned to new situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You listen to different perspectives, ask questions, share your ideas, and enjoy solving problems as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sense of &lt;strong&gt;ownership and accountability&lt;/strong&gt; for your work, combined with the confidence to ask for help when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and &lt;strong&gt;structured problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to adapt when requirements, constraints, or new information change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to create high-quality solutions and learn good practices around &lt;strong&gt;testing, version control, and software delivery&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript, REST APIs/API specifications, Git, Docker, Redux/RTK Query, Playwright, or Vitest&lt;/strong&gt; is an advantage rather than an expectation that you already know everything.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;re passionate about your work, but also know how to enjoy your free time!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX0 SCXW188870906&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX0 SCXW188870906&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX0 SCXW188870906&quot;&gt; } ;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have the feeling you don&#39;t match every single requirement? Don’t worry! We encourage you to apply anyways, even if your qualifications do not align perfectly. You might still be just the right candidate for us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{ { … &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a_place_to_stay_together:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;From Morning Daily to Afterwork Drink, team spirit is essential to us. The heart of our togetherness is that we truly are connected with each other: We not only share fun &amp;amp; laughter, but also honest opinions - because that&#39;s how we grow: We exchange ideas, give support in our personal development, and celebrate success together! Besides our great community, we also offer numerous other&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dkbcodefactory.com/jobs#what-we-offer&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;benefits&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; …&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/TH4zQxp.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;700&quot;&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;} } ;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern - Fullstack (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to build innovative products and features that improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. You will work in a feature team developing solutions that directly impact healthcare professionals and patients across Europe, contributing to our Operating System powered by AI to manage all clinical and administrative activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features alongside experienced engineers — from design and development to testing and shipping — with a direct impact on real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, product managers, and designers to solve complex technical challenges and build scalable, secure, and user-friendly healthcare tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient code following industry best practices in design, testing, and peer review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world problems that directly enhance patient care and improve doctor-patient relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new tools and technologies, including AI and distributed systems, as part of your continuous growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration by sharing knowledge and engaging actively with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;122&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love problem-solving and are driven by curiosity — you&#39;re not afraid to dive into complex issues and find creative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment and enjoy working with cross-functional teams, sharing knowledge, and learning from your peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for technology and product development, and always keep the user experience in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable coding, with the help of AI agents like Claude Code, in multiple languages and eager to learn our tech stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are in your final year of a degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science, or a related field and looking for a 6-month full-time internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn and work in a team of builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with web development or building products in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on side projects or contributed to open-source communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with AI-assisted coding tools and eager to integrate them into your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Deutschlandticket&lt;/span&gt; sponsored by Doctolib if you work from the office or in a hybrid setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Company health insurance&lt;/span&gt; with excellent additional benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;mental health and coaching sessions&lt;/span&gt; provided through an external partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;In addition to healthy snacks and a regular breakfast buffet, we offer &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;meal vouchers&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidized sports program with our partner &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Urban Sports Club&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Tech masterclasses&lt;/span&gt; throughout the internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Free breakfast at the office&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;AI tools for coding and development&lt;/span&gt;, as well as dedicated training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;122&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview (30 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature Building Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship (6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Berlin&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
