&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 51); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;looking for an experienced Engineering Manager to lead one or more of our cross-functional product development teams at Rightmove.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;building a healthy, high-performing team by enabling others to do their best work,&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;strong delivery focus, and fostering a culture that reflects our values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 51); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Engineering Managers at Rightmove are not just people leaders, but delivery enablers, engineering advocates, and strategic partners to Product Managers.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;work collaboratively to ensure teams are focusing on the right things, solving valuable problems, and&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;in a sustainable, inclusive way.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;a big impact&amp;nbsp;on the shape of our engineering organisation, playing a key role in how we plan, deliver, grow talent, and scale systems across the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 51); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 4, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note from your future manager: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;By joining us, you&#39;ll lead a team building the tools our CX colleagues depend on every day, and help shape how AI and our backoffice transformation change their work. Expect honest feedback, room to grow, and a manager who&#39;ll back you all the way.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
