&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – E-Commerce Web Upper Funnel [Permanent - CDI] (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris or Lille, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Decathlon E-Commerce Web – Scope Upper Funnel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of Decathlon’s global digital ecosystem, our &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web&lt;/strong&gt; team builds the online destination for millions of sports lovers worldwide. The &lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt; scope is the front door of our digital experience: from landing on the homepage and navigating categories, to discovering products via search, AI-driven recommendations, conversational shopping, retail media placements, and inspiring content. Our mission is to seamlessly guide users from inspiration to intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining this high-traffic Web Product organization means operating at massive scale where speed, discovery excellence, SEO, targeted monetization, and next-gen personalized user journeys drive our everyday business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide the strategic direction, functional architecture, and product leadership needed to scale and modernize the discovery and exploration experience across Decathlon&#39;s web platform. Operating with high autonomy, you will address complex challenges across search performance, catalog structuring, retail media integration, and emerging AI paradigm shifts like conversational interface models and agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission centers on 4 strategic pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategic Alignment, Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Upper Funnel Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Holistic Discovery &amp;amp; Engagement Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and drive the strategic vision for upper funnel web touchpoints (Homepage, Category/Listing Pages, Search Engine, Navigation Taxonomy, Retail Media Ad Placements, Conversational Assistants, and Inspiration Hubs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with global business directors, commercial/merchandising leads, SEO specialists, retail media monetization teams, and AI platform engineering leads to align executive leadership around major web platform shifts and discovery roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macro Metrics &amp;amp; Funnel Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Track, measure, and optimize key upper funnel metrics across the customer journey: Organic/Direct Traffic, Search CTR, Category Depth, Conversational Engagement &amp;amp; Intent Resolution Rate, Ad Yield/eCPM, Bounce Rate, Product Detail Page (PDP) Click-through Rate, and Top-of-Funnel Conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Web Ecosystem Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Functional Architect&lt;/strong&gt;: Define boundary maps and functional scope across web squads (Search &amp;amp; Conversational Discovery, Taxonomy &amp;amp; Merchandising, Personalization/Recommendations, Retail Media &amp;amp; Sponsored Listings) to eliminate overlap and friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tight Triad Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work in close sync with Staff/Principal Web Engineers and Staff UX/UI Designers to align frontend performance (Core Web Vitals), modular web design systems, micro-frontend architecture, conversational UI patterns, and backend search/ad-serving APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seamless Omnichannel &amp;amp; Funnel Handoff&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure fluid transitions from external acquisition channels into the web upper funnel, balancing organic product discovery and agentic assistance with sponsored/retail media inventory while designing seamless handoffs toward the lower funnel (PDP, Cart &amp;amp; Checkout).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Strategic Sparring &amp;amp; Product De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted Strategic Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as a sparring partner for Group Product Managers (GPMs) and Product Managers (PMs) within the Web &amp;amp; E-Commerce domain, helping them navigate complex search algorithms, LLM agent architectures, ad server integrations, taxonomy dependencies, and high-volume web constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De-Risking High-Stakes Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: Formulate and execute validation strategies for high-risk discovery and monetization concepts (e.g., visual/voice search, conversational product advisors, agentic auto-replenishment/bundles, sponsored product placements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Experimentation at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and lead high-volume A/B and multivariate testing strategies, balancing conversational interaction models and ad impression density against organic conversion performance using CRO frameworks and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Elevating Product Craft &amp;amp; Modern Web Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First, Agentic &amp;amp; Monetization Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the organizational adoption of cloud-native AI platforms (e.g., Google Vertex AI), conversational frameworks, agentic e-commerce patterns, and modern retail media capabilities to amplify both user experience and platform revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Craft &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Upskill the PM community in modern web product practices, continuous discovery frameworks, technical web performance optimization, and data-informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Multiplier&lt;/strong&gt;: Elevate the overall bar of the Product Management organization as a thought leader without acting as a direct line manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TABLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web Scale (7+ years)&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record in Product Management with hands-on experience scaling high-traffic e-commerce web platforms (Upper Funnel, Search, Merchandising, or Navigation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel &amp;amp; SEO Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of top-of-funnel mechanics, technical SEO, site search algorithms, taxonomy design, and conversion rate optimization (CRO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Discovery Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong expertise in web analytics (GA4/Amplitude/Contentsquare), high-traffic A/B testing frameworks, quantitative/qualitative user research, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to decompose complex e-commerce catalog, ad-tech, and AI/search problems into modular MVP/V0/V1 execution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Storytelling &amp;amp; Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional ability to translate complex search/agentic architectures, retail media revenue drivers, UX metrics, and conversion data into compelling narratives for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Pluses &amp;amp; Emerging Tech Strengths&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Vertex AI&lt;/strong&gt;: Practical experience using Google Vertex AI (for Search, Recommendations, or custom ML/LLM model deployment) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversational &amp;amp; Agentic E-Commerce&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid understanding or experience with conversational AI interfaces (chat/voice product advisors) and agentic commerce concepts (autonomous intent-matching, task-oriented AI agents) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media &amp;amp; Monetization&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with Retail Media concepts and ad management (sponsored products, ad-server integrations, balancing yield vs. UX) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong strategic influence, ability to thrive in ambiguity, passion for cross-functional collaboration in Triad, and an empathetic approach to mentoring junior PMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt; (Paris or Lille base) 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Equipment&lt;/strong&gt; (Mac or Windows, according to mission and sustainability commitments);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;: Local project team within a global retail and digital network with international career opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Internal/external trainings, skill development programs, and conference attendance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Competitive salary package including employee stock ownership, profit-sharing, and monthly/quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSQ128R8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV Partners with $100M in Series B funding, we’re building a fast-growing, revenue-generating company working with Fortune 500 customers globally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the front line: you engage directly with enterprise clients, lead discovery to uncover core business challenges, and design and ship tailored AI solutions built on Unframe&#39;s platform. You own the work end-to-end, serving as the strategic and technical bridge from initial conversation through to final deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true builder role. You write the precise specifications and prompt architectures that bring solutions to life, making the critical design decisions that determine whether an enterprise AI deployment actually succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-led role with unmediated access to clients at every stage. You will typically manage several engagements simultaneously, with short planning horizons and evolving requirements. Roughly 30 to 40 percent of the role is active client management, ensuring senior stakeholders remain aligned through delivery, progress reviews, and post-deployment rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Enterprise Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct discovery sessions directly with enterprise clients to map workflows, uncover business challenges, and distinguish surface-level requests from fundamental operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Spec AI Solutions: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate customer problems into structured solution plans on Unframe&#39;s platform. Write detailed specs and define prompt and context structures, owning the complete solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive End-to-End Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers and AI specialists to deliver solutions on target. Prioritize requirements and manage tradeoffs across speed, stability, and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the User &amp;amp; Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the voice of enterprise operators and domain experts while collaborating with the Platform team to identify reusable product patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or technical delivery roles, with a proven track record working alongside engineering teams on complex, fast-paced technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bilingual Fluency (English &amp;amp; French):&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in French to connect with users and stakeholders in France, and fluent in English for daily collaboration across our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Led Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience personally leading consultative conversations with enterprise buyers and operators - not supporting a sales call, not interviewing platform users, but owning the conversation to surface unstated needs and translate them into clear solution scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to manage senior client relationships through a complex delivery; keeping stakeholders aligned, navigating competing priorities, and being the primary point of contact when requirements shift or timelines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-to-Solution Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to start from a raw business problem without existing features for reference, defining exactly how an AI solution should function and writing precise specs for build teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Delivery Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience shipping AI-powered features under tight timelines, managing evolving requirements, and documenting strategic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct exposure to building with LLMs - writing prompt structures, defining context and output constraints, working with agentic systems, or managing model uncertainty in a shipped product or working prototype. This is the dimension most learnable on the job; concrete work product carries more weight than certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by creating customer-facing solutions rather than simply managing traditional roadmaps or processing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written communication, systems thinking, high attention to detail, fluent English (written and verbal), and the ability to navigate multi-faceted projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Remote (France):&lt;/strong&gt; This position is 100% remote within France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Unframe, you’ll help build AI systems that are already delivering real value to global enterprises - not prototypes, demos, or side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You’ll work with exceptional teammates, collaborate directly with top-tier customers, and have real influence over both the solutions we ship and the evolution of our platform. This is a hands-on, high-impact role where product thinking, technical depth, and creativity come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving hard problems, moving fast, and building practical AI products that actually make it to production - we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern - Fullstack (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to build innovative products and features that improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. You will work in a feature team developing solutions that directly impact healthcare professionals and patients across Europe, contributing to our Operating System powered by AI to manage all clinical and administrative activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features alongside experienced engineers — from design and development to testing and shipping — with a direct impact on real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, product managers, and designers to solve complex technical challenges and build scalable, secure, and user-friendly healthcare tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient code following industry best practices in design, testing, and peer review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world problems that directly enhance patient care and improve doctor-patient relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new tools and technologies, including AI and distributed systems, as part of your continuous growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration by sharing knowledge and engaging actively with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love problem-solving and are driven by curiosity — you&#39;re not afraid to dive into complex issues and find creative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment and enjoy working with cross-functional teams, sharing knowledge, and learning from your peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for technology and product development, and always keep the user experience in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable coding, with the help of AI agents like Claude Code, in multiple languages and eager to learn our tech stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are in your final year of a degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science, or a related field and looking for a 6-month full-time internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn and work in a team of builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with web development or building products in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on side projects or contributed to open-source communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with AI-assisted coding tools and eager to integrate them into your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech masterclasses throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding and development, along with dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted membership to Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers worth €8.50 per day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of public transportation subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health insurance, fully covered by Doctolib for employees and their children under the basic plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and personalised coaching programme with our partner, &lt;a href=&quot;http://moka.care/&quot;&gt;Moka.care&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive three-month onboarding programme, including Doctolib Academy and various training courses in languages, soft skills, and technical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A works council subsidy providing partial reimbursement for sports or leisure activity memberships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For employees with disabilities or caregiving responsibilities, a support package including adapted remote-working arrangements, paid authorised leave for medical appointments, and enhanced psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview (30 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature Building Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship (6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris (Levallois)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For data processing details, click here:&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt; Germany&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt; France&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt; Italy&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt; Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

