&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Join a team of passionate and committed people working to improve healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, our tech teams build products and features that improve the daily lives of healthcare professionals and patients. We work in feature teams within an agile environment, in close collaboration with Product, Design, Data Science, and Business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Tech team and contribute to the development of AI-powered features at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with experienced AI and software engineers to explore, prototype, evaluate, and improve AI-based solutions. This internship will give you the opportunity to gain practical experience across the different stages of an AI product, from experimentation to integration into a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of AI features and services under the guidance of experienced engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Python code to support prototypes, experiments, evaluation tools, and backend components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with large language models, prompting techniques, retrieval, and tool integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to automated tests and documentation for the components you develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate issues, analyse results, and suggest improvements to your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, technical discussions, and team rituals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will receive regular guidance from your mentor and teammates. The scope of your work will grow progressively as you become familiar with the codebase, the tools, and the technical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on, if you do not have the exact profile described below but feel that this internship matches your skills and interests, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are in the final year of a degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Software Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have basic experience with Python through coursework, personal projects, research, or previous internships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a basic understanding of programming concepts, data structures, and software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about artificial intelligence and interested in understanding how AI systems work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable communicating in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on a project involving machine learning, natural language processing, or large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have used agentic frameworks like Langchain or Google ADK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI APIs, prompting, retrieval, or conversational interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in taking products to production and supporting them with real users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have some experience with Git, APIs, testing, or data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in healthcare, privacy, or responsible AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our products are built on a cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile applications across several countries and healthcare systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if Doctolib uses technologies like Ruby on Rails, TypeScript, Java, Kotlin, Swift, React Native, and many cloud-related technologies, the principal language you&#39;ll work on is Python.You will also have the opportunity to use AI-assisted development tools within our engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; and learn more about our tech culture on the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt; Doctolib Tech site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured internship with dedicated mentoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work on real AI projects in a healthcare environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical learning sessions and access to internal engineering communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to AI tools for coding, development, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy, depending on the team and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, 6 months, full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Berlin, Paris, Nantes, Milan, or Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup, up to 2 remote days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. We evaluate candidates based on their qualifications, motivation, and potential, without discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the better our products can serve patients and healthcare professionals. We welcome applications regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability, or place of origin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support an inclusive recruitment process, we invite you to leave personal information such as pictures and age off your application. If you require an accommodation during the interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
