&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Design and develop the APIs and backend components that power payments for thousands of merchants and millions of consumers across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar on quality, security &amp;amp; performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Write maintainable, production-grade code that meets the highest standards of a regulated company processing billions of euros.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our technical architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Product and other tech leaders to evolve our architecture in line with growing business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
